{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44725","headline":"留别忠州故人 · 灵一","name":"留别忠州故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一身无定处，万里独销魂。\n芳草迷归路，春流滴泪痕。\n几时休旅食，何夜宿江村。\n欲识相思苦，空山啼暮猨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}